    "result_text": "Both tests pass. The full-stack change is complete. Here's a summary of what I implemented:\n\n## Change: track clients (name + email) with a list and an add form\n\n**Database** \u2014 `src/main/resources/db/migration/V1__clients.sql`\n- New Flyway migration creating the `clients` table (`id`, `name`, `email`). `GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY` so the seed path can insert explicit fixture ids.\n\n**Server (OfficeFloor REST on Spring)** \u2014 additive, one file per endpoint\n- `Client.java` \u2014 JPA entity for the `clients` table.\n- `ClientRepository.java` \u2014 Spring Data repo with `findAllByOrderByIdAsc()`.\n- `NewClient.java` \u2014 request-body DTO for creation.\n- `ClientsGet.java` + `rest/api/clients.GET.yml` \u2192 `GET /api/clients` (list all).\n- `ClientsPost.java` + `rest/api/clients.POST.yml` \u2192 `POST /api/clients` (create, returns saved row).\n- `TestSupportController.java` \u2014 extended `/__test__/reset` (`TRUNCATE ... RESTART IDENTITY`) and `/__test__/seed` (insert clients with explicit fixture ids via `JdbcTemplate`).\n\n**Front-end** \u2014 all new files, nothing existing edited\n- `routes/clients.index.tsx` \u2014 the `/clients` page composing the form + table.\n- `features/clients/nav.slot.tsx` \u2014 fills `AppNav` with the `nav-clients` link.\n- `features/clients/queries.ts` \u2014 the `['clients']` query key, fetch + create helpers.\n- `features/clients/ClientsTable.tsx` \u2014 self-querying list, with `clients-table` / `clients-empty` and `client-row-<id>` / `client-name` / `client-email`.\n- `features/clients/ClientForm.tsx` \u2014 `useMutation` + `invalidateQueries(['clients'])`; fields `client-form-name`, `client-form-email`, submit `client-form-submit`.\n\nAll `data-testid` anchors match the spec exactly. `bin/e2e`: **2 passed**.",
